{"ticker":"CFG","updated":"2026-10-23T22:45:35Z","profile":{"longName":"Citizens Financial Group, Inc.","shortName":"Citizens Financial Group, Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","country":"United States","website":"https://www.citizensbank.com","fullTimeEmployees":17609,"marketCap":27438258176,"trailingPE":14.191721,"forwardPE":10.034305,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.2687943,"pegRatio":1.65,"targetMeanPrice":76.60526,"targetHighPrice":87.0,"targetLowPrice":65.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.119,"earningsGrowth":0.343,"grossMargins":0.0,"operatingMargins":0.36595002,"profitMargins":0.27019,"totalRevenue":8393999872,"beta":1.062,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":75.33,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":49.0,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.19},"summary":"Citizens Financial Group, Inc. operates as the bank holding company that provides retail and commercial banking products and services to individuals, small businesses, middle-market companies, large corporations, and institutions in the United States. The company operates through two segments, Consumer Banking and Commercial Banking. The Consumer Banking segment offers deposit products, mortgage and home equity lending products, credit cards, business loans, and wealth management services; and education and point-of-sale finance loans, as well as digital deposit products. This segment serves its customers through telephone service centers, as well as through its online and mobile platforms. The Commercial Banking segment provides various financial products and solutions, including lending and leasing, deposit and treasury management services, foreign exchange, and interest rate and commodity risk management solutions, as well as syndicated loans, corporate finance, mergers and acquisitions, and debt and equity capital markets services. The company serves customers and small businesses, high- and ultra-high-net-worth individuals and families, as well as investors, entrepreneurs, and companies and institutions, as well as multifamily, office, industrial, retail, healthcare, and hospitality sectors. The company was formerly known as RBS Citizens Financial Group, Inc. and changed i","summary_zh":"Citizens Financial Group, Inc. 作為銀行控股公司經營，為美國的個人、小型企業、中型市場公司、大型企業和機構提供零售和商業銀行產品和服務。該公司透過兩個部門運作：消費者銀行業務和商業銀行業務。消費者銀行業務部門提供存款產品、抵押貸款和房屋淨值貸款產品、信用卡、商業貸款和財富管理服務；教育和銷售點金融貸款以及數位存款產品。該部門透過電話服務中心以及線上和行動平台為客戶提供服務。商業銀行部門提供各種金融產品和解決方案，包括貸款和租賃、存款和資金管理服務、外匯、利率和商品風險管理解決方案，以及銀團貸款、企業融資、併購以及債務和股權資本市場服務。該公司為客戶和小型企業、高淨值和超高淨值個人和家庭、投資者、企業家、公司和機構以及多戶家庭、辦公室、工業、零售、醫療保健和酒店業提供服務。該公司前身為 RBS Citizens Financial Group, Inc.，後來更名為 RBS Citizens Financial Group, Inc.。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"銀行 - 區域","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":50.64,"h":50.88,"l":50.37,"c":50.69,"v":2935400},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":50.5,"h":51.4,"l":50.47,"c":51.31,"v":4097200},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":51.06,"h":52.025,"l":51.06,"c":51.9,"v":2991400},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":52.12,"h":52.2,"l":51.74,"c":52.16,"v":3833100},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":52.19,"h":52.525,"l":51.99,"c":52.28,"v":2617400},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":51.4,"h":51.865,"l":50.995,"c":51.6,"v":5375500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":51.61,"h":52.215,"l":51.06,"c":51.67,"v":3084100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":51.93,"h":52.515,"l":51.61,"c":52.51,"v":2806800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":52.61,"h":52.85,"l":51.25,"c":51.71,"v":2997600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":51.87,"h":51.87,"l":50.92,"c":51.7,"v":3396100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":51.73,"h":52.305,"l":51.46,"c":51.71,"v":3971000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":52.01,"h":52.14,"l":51.5,"c":51.81,"v":3332400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":51.81,"h":52.105,"l":51.41,"c":51.76,"v":4397900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":51.67,"h":52.075,"l":51.495,"c":51.82,"v":3733200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":51.86,"h":52.04,"l":51.235,"c":51.34,"v":2861800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":51.42,"h":51.42,"l":50.415,"c":51.13,"v":4780000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":51.15,"h":53.0,"l":51.15,"c":52.27,"v":6756000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":52.61,"h":